 "voice": "am_eric",
 "script": "Your plan only works on *good* days. || One bad day, and it *breaks*. || Give every habit a *bad-day* version. || Run 5K \u2192 run *1* lap. || Study 2 hours \u2192 open the *book*. || The chain doesn't *break*. || That's Dmyor. || Link's in the bio.",
 "spoken": "[hook] Your plan only works on good days. || And the moment you have a bad day, the whole thing falls apart. We've all been there. || [turn] So give every habit a bad-day version. A tiny one. || If you planned a five K run, the bad-day version is one lap around the block. || Planned two hours of study? On a bad day, you just open the book. || [land] It sounds small, but it keeps the chain going. And honestly, that's the whole game. || [outro] That's the kind of plan Dmyor is built around. || [outro] And if you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
